      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "# DIP v4.2 Compliance Audit Summary\n## Executive Overview\n## Key Requirements\n### Encryption Standards\n#### Encryption at Rest\nAll user data must be encrypted at rest using AES-256.\n#### Encryption Algorithms\nThe specific algorithm mandated is AES-256 for all data at rest.\n### Log Retention Policies\n#### Access Log Storage\nAccess logs must be retained for 7 years.\n#### Retention Duration\nThe mandatory retention period is exactly 7 years.\n### Breach Reporting Timelines\n#### Incident Notification\nAny breach must be reported to the oversight committee within 24 hours.\n#### Reporting Deadline\nThe strict deadline for breach notification is 24 hours.\n### Vulnerability Scan Schedules\n#### Scan Frequency\nPeriodic vulnerability scans are mandatory every quarter.\n#### Scan Interval\nScans must occur on a quarterly basis without exception.\n### Vendor Agreement Mandates\n#### Third-Party Contracts\nAll third-party vendors must sign a Data Processing Agreement (DPA) before receiving any PII.\n#### Pre-Service Agreements\nA signed DPA is required prior to any PII transfer.\n## Implementation Status\n## Risk Assessment\n## Remediation Actions",
